mimeyer wrote:
>
> I've been playing the dev/null/nethack tournament, and I've come
> across a really annoying thing.  I'm playing a Valkyrie at level 10.
> Coaligned altars in Minetown and one in the dungeons themselves.  But
> I've been sacrificing tons of monsters trying for Mjollnir and simply
> can't get it.  Is it possible that it's in a bones file and that's why
> I can't get it?
>
> I'm using Excalibur but I prefer "hammer time."  Any suggestions for
> figuring out what's up?  Or does the RNG hate me?

For classes with a guaranteed first gift it is possible to get locked
out of any gifts if that artifact already exists (bones, on the floor,
wish, etc) for non-gift reasons.  The code knows there have been no
gifts, fails to create the first gift, drops through like the artifact
creation failed.

The way out of that is getting crowned.  If your Excalibur was from
crowning it counts as the first gift and you aren't sacrificing enough. 
If your Excalibur was from dipping you might be in that lock out
situation.  Wield a mundane long sword and go for getting crowned.


